        "detailed_description": "<h1>Full Version Premiere on September 9, 2025</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645040/extras/ad38cbb758877abe51c00fa3711e1d40.avif?t=1759483149\" width=616 height=220 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sweet Start is not just a taste of what's to come - it’s a standalone experience that lets you explore the mechanics and atmosphere of building your candy empire</h2><br>Please remember that this is just the beginning of an amazing adventure that awaits you in Candy Shop Simulator!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BEGIN YOUR SWEET ADVENTURE!</h2>Candy Shop Simulator: Sweet Start is your first step into the world of confectionery entrepreneurship. Open your small shop and get to know the basics of managing your business, crafting delightful treats, and serving customers. It’s the ideal starting point for your journey toward becoming a candy tycoon!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645040/extras/3734361970c121613070bab6ab0b5dd7.poster.avif?t=1759483149\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645040/extras/3734361970c121613070bab6ab0b5dd7.webm?t=1759483149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645040/extras/3734361970c121613070bab6ab0b5dd7.mp4?t=1759483149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE UNIQUE PASTRIES</h2>Sweet Start gives you the chance to experiment with basic recipes for sweets in the full version of Candy Shop Simulator you will get a massive range ons sweets. Unleash your creativity and craft delightful pastries that will charm your customers. This is a great way to familiarize yourself with the production process, which will be even more advanced in the full version of the game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645040/extras/2a16e7df38ac91d34f2be541447090dc.poster.avif?t=1759483149\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645040/extras/2a16e7df38ac91d34f2be541447090dc.webm?t=1759483149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645040/extras/2a16e7df38ac91d34f2be541447090dc.mp4?t=1759483149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SELL YOUR CREATIONS</h2>Open your shop doors in Sweet Start and watch as your sugary creations attract your first customers. Learn how to manage sales and build relationships with patrons - skills that will be essential in the full version of Candy Shop Simulator.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645040/extras/3d00e4bed85f92c1e8b80e3dba9a6c22.poster.avif?t=1759483149\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645040/extras/3d00e4bed85f92c1e8b80e3dba9a6c22.webm?t=1759483149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645040/extras/3d00e4bed85f92c1e8b80e3dba9a6c22.mp4?t=1759483149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PREPARE FOR MORE!</h2>Candy Shop Simulator: Sweet Start is just the beginning of your adventure. The full version of the game offers so much more—from new recipes and shop expansions to advanced marketing strategies and team management. Sweet Start gives you a taste of what’s waiting for you in the future!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645040/extras/de96bca0b9f00cc3410dca1daf34204b.poster.avif?t=1759483149\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645040/extras/de96bca0b9f00cc3410dca1daf34204b.webm?t=1759483149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645040/extras/de96bca0b9f00cc3410dca1daf34204b.mp4?t=1759483149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Candy Shop Simulator: Sweet Start is the perfect option for those who want to test their skills and explore the world of Candy Shop Simulator before committing to the full version. It’s not just a prologue - it’s a standalone experience that prepares you for even greater challenges ahead!",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sweet Start is not just a taste of what's to come - it’s a standalone experience that lets you explore the mechanics and atmosphere of building your candy empire</h2><br>Please remember that this is just the beginning of an amazing adventure that awaits you in Candy Shop Simulator!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BEGIN YOUR SWEET ADVENTURE!</h2>Candy Shop Simulator: Sweet Start is your first step into the world of confectionery entrepreneurship. Open your small shop and get to know the basics of managing your business, crafting delightful treats, and serving customers. It’s the ideal starting point for your journey toward becoming a candy tycoon!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645040/extras/3734361970c121613070bab6ab0b5dd7.poster.avif?t=1759483149\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645040/extras/3734361970c121613070bab6ab0b5dd7.webm?t=1759483149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645040/extras/3734361970c121613070bab6ab0b5dd7.mp4?t=1759483149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE UNIQUE PASTRIES</h2>Sweet Start gives you the chance to experiment with basic recipes for sweets in the full version of Candy Shop Simulator you will get a massive range ons sweets. Unleash your creativity and craft delightful pastries that will charm your customers. This is a great way to familiarize yourself with the production process, which will be even more advanced in the full version of the game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645040/extras/2a16e7df38ac91d34f2be541447090dc.poster.avif?t=1759483149\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645040/extras/2a16e7df38ac91d34f2be541447090dc.webm?t=1759483149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645040/extras/2a16e7df38ac91d34f2be541447090dc.mp4?t=1759483149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SELL YOUR CREATIONS</h2>Open your shop doors in Sweet Start and watch as your sugary creations attract your first customers. Learn how to manage sales and build relationships with patrons - skills that will be essential in the full version of Candy Shop Simulator.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645040/extras/3d00e4bed85f92c1e8b80e3dba9a6c22.poster.avif?t=1759483149\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645040/extras/3d00e4bed85f92c1e8b80e3dba9a6c22.webm?t=1759483149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645040/extras/3d00e4bed85f92c1e8b80e3dba9a6c22.mp4?t=1759483149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PREPARE FOR MORE!</h2>Candy Shop Simulator: Sweet Start is just the beginning of your adventure. The full version of the game offers so much more—from new recipes and shop expansions to advanced marketing strategies and team management. Sweet Start gives you a taste of what’s waiting for you in the future!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645040/extras/de96bca0b9f00cc3410dca1daf34204b.poster.avif?t=1759483149\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645040/extras/de96bca0b9f00cc3410dca1daf34204b.webm?t=1759483149\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645040/extras/de96bca0b9f00cc3410dca1daf34204b.mp4?t=1759483149\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Candy Shop Simulator: Sweet Start is the perfect option for those who want to test their skills and explore the world of Candy Shop Simulator before committing to the full version. It’s not just a prologue - it’s a standalone experience that prepares you for even greater challenges ahead!",
